    "text": "By Island News Web Staff ,\n8 hours ago PAHOA, Hawaii (Island News) – An investigation is underway following two separate “suspicious” deaths of elderly men that occurred in Puna in the past two days. Police are seeking 36-year-old Jacob Daniel Baker, of Pahoa, who was confirmed to be the suspect in three homicides in the Puna area. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
